    "trigger": {
     "when": [
      "arrive:training"
     ]
    },
    "setup": [
     "{mate.name} has sat in his car with the engine off for forty minutes before training, three days running. He's just looking at the wheel. Today you've parked next to him."
    ],
    "talk": {
     "start": "c1",
     "nodes": {
      "c1": {
       "who": "mate",
       "say": [
        "He doesn't see you. His phone's face down on the passenger seat. It's raining."
       ],
       "replies": [
        {
         "id": "knock",
         "label": "Knock on the window. \"All right, mate?\"",
         "tone": "kind",
         "goto": "c2"
        },
        {
         "id": "physio",
         "label": "Go in and mention it to the physio.",
         "tone": "calm",
         "end": "physio"
        },
        {
         "id": "leave",
         "label": "Leave him be. Everyone has weeks.",
         "tone": "cold",
         "end": "left"
        }
       ]
      },
      "c2": {
       "who": "mate",
       "say": [
        "He winds it down. \"Yeah. Fine. Just tired.\" He's not looking at you."
       ],
       "replies": [
        {
         "id": "time",
         "label": "\"You don't have to be fine. I've got time.\"",
         "tone": "kind",
         "goto": "c3"
        },
        {
         "id": "ok",
         "label": "\"Fair enough. See you in there.\"",
         "tone": "calm",
         "end": "left"
        }
       ]
      },
      "c3": {
       "who": "mate",
       "say": [
        "A long time. Then: he hasn't slept properly for weeks. Everything feels heavy, even the good stuff. He hasn't told his partner. He hasn't told anyone. \"I don't know what's wrong with me.\""
       ],
       "replies": [
        {
         "id": "doctor",
         "label": "\"Will you see the club doctor? I'll come in with you.\"",
         "tone": "kind",
         "end": "doctor"
        },
        {
         "id": "between",
         "label": "\"This stays with me. Unless I'm worried about you.\"",
         "tone": "honest",
         "end": "between"
        },
        {
         "id": "sit",
         "label": "Get in the passenger side. Sit with him.",
         "tone": "kind",
         "end": "sat"
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     "ends": {
      "doctor": [
       {
        "text": "He nods. You walk in with him, past the canteen, to the doctor's door. You wait outside. It's an hour. When he comes out he looks the same, but he's breathing differently.",
        "npc": [
         {
          "slot": "mate",
          "bond": 10,
          "respect": 6
         }
        ],
        "remember": [
         {
          "slot": "mate",
          "tag": "walked-me-to-the-doctor",
          "strength": 3
         }
        ],
        "arc": {
         "set": {
          "path": "doctor"
         }
        }
       }
      ],
      "between": [
       {
        "text": "\"Ok.\" He sits for a bit. Then he says he'll ring his GP tonight. You tell him you'll text him at nine to check. You do. He has.",
        "npc": [
         {
          "slot": "mate",
          "bond": 8,
          "respect": 6
         }
        ],
        "remember": [
         {
          "slot": "mate",
          "tag": "listened-in-the-car-park",
          "strength": 3
         }
        ],
        "arc": {
         "set": {
          "path": "listened"
         }
        }
       }
      ],
      "sat": [
       {
        "text": "You sit in the passenger seat for twenty minutes. You're both late in. The physio doesn't say anything. When you get out he says, \"Will you come with me to see the doctor? Tomorrow?\" You will.",
        "npc": [
         {
          "slot": "mate",
          "bond": 10,
          "respect": 4
         }
        ],
        "remember": [
         {
          "slot": "mate",
          "tag": "sat-in-my-car-with-me",
          "strength": 3
         }
        ],
        "arc": {
         "set": {
          "path": "doctor"
         }
        }
       }
      ],
      "physio": [
       {
        "text": "{physio.name} listens and puts her coffee down. \"Thank you. Leave it with me.\" She goes out to the car park in the rain without a coat.",
        "npc": [
         {
          "slot": "physio",
          "bond": 2,
          "respect": 6
         }
        ],
        "arc": {
         "set": {
          "path": "physio"
         }
        }
       }
      ],
      "left": [
       {
        "text": "You go in. Through the dressing room window you can see his car. It's another ten minutes before he comes in, and he's fine in training, and he isn't.",
        "arc": {
         "set": {
          "path": "left"
         }
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    },
